      <h2 class="major">Why join BH2?</h2>
      <p>Whether you want to speak on stages, lead with confidence, or simply stop dreading presentations at work, Toastmasters gives you a structured, supportive space to practise.</p>
      <section class="features">
        <article>
          <a href="/experience/" class="image"><img src="/images/speaker2.jpg" alt="Member speaking at BH2 meeting" /></a>
          <h3 class="major">Prepared Speeches</h3>
          <p>Work through a structured Pathways program at your own pace. Each speech builds confidence, vocal variety, body language, and storytelling skills over time.</p>
          <a href="/experience/" class="special">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <a href="/experience/" class="image"><img src="/images/speaker3.jpg" alt="Table Topics speaker at BH2" /></a>
          <h3 class="major">Table Topics</h3>
          <p>The impromptu speaking segment. Members are given a question and have two minutes to respond on their feet — fast, fun, and one of the best ways to sharpen thinking-on-your-feet skills.</p>
          <a href="/experience/" class="special">Learn more</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <a href="/achievements/" class="image"><img src="/images/award.jpg" alt="Award presentation at BH2 Toastmasters" /></a>
          <h3 class="major">Recognition and Awards</h3>
          <p>Best Speaker, Best Table Topics, and Best Evaluator awards are given at each meeting. Club, area, and district contests give members a stage to shine beyond the club.</p>
          <a href="/achievements/" class="special">See our achievements</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <a href="/join/" class="image"><img src="/images/meeting2.jpg" alt="BH2 Toastmasters members networking" /></a>
